# Global navigation and shared components (`public/components/`) — ⚠️ LEGACY v1 (DEPRECATED)

> **Legacy v1 UI.** Production frontend is the **v2 React SPA in `frontend/`** (global nav is [`frontend/src/components/AppShell`](../../frontend/src/components/AppShell)). This `public/components/` is served only as a rollback (`EXCELSIOR_DISABLE_SPA=1`). Do **not** add features here — see [`docs/current/FRONTEND_V2.md`](../../docs/current/FRONTEND_V2.md). Removal tracked in [`DEAD_CODE_POLICY.md`](../../DEAD_CODE_POLICY.md).

- **globalNav:** [`globalNav.html`](globalNav.html), [`globalNav.css`](globalNav.css), [`globalNav.js`](globalNav.js). Injected into `#globalNav` from [`public/js/app-initialization.js`](../js/app-initialization.js).
- **Desktop layout:** **[`.header-nav-cluster`](globalNav.html)** wraps **`.header-center`** + **`.header-right`**. **[`globalNav.css`](globalNav.css)** sets **`.header-nav-cluster { display: contents }`** so flex children behave like **logo \| centered view tabs \| user area** — **+ Deck** (**`#newDeckBtn`**) is the first child of **`.header-right`**, immediately left of **`#userMenu`**.
- **Mobile (`html.layout-mobile`):** Rules live in [`public/css/mobile-layout.css`](../css/mobile-layout.css) — not only `globalNav.css` `@media`. Full spec: **[`/MOBILE_DESIGN.md`](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md) §10.1**.
  - **MV header (grid):** **`.unified-header`** **`display: grid`**, **`grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto`**, **`column-gap: 6px`**, **`min-height: 56px`**, **`padding: 6px 8px`**. **`.header-nav-cluster`** **`display: contents`** — **`.header-left`** / **`.header-center`** / **`.header-right`** are grid items (**cols 1–3**); **`.header-center`** **`justify-content: center`**. **`.app-tabs`** **flex** (**`gap: 3px`**, **`padding-inline: 5%`**); **`.app-tab-button`** **`flex: 1 1 0`**, **`min-height: 35px`**, **`padding: 5px 3px`**, **`font-size: 12px`**, **`inline-flex`** label centering. **`.header-left`** logo **`max-width: 105px`**, **`.header-logo`** **`max-height: 52px`**. **`#newDeckBtn`** **`display: none`**.
  - **Collection hidden:** **[`syncHeaderCollectionLayout()`](globalNav.js)** sets **`display: none`** on Collection and adds **`.collection-tab-hidden`**: **Database** **`flex: 1 1 0`**, **Deck Builder** **`flex: 2 1 0`**.
  - **Collection tab body (mobile list + detail):** **`#collection-view`** / [`collection-view.js`](../js/collection-view.js) — [`docs/current/COLLECTION_VIEW_MOBILE.md`](../../docs/current/COLLECTION_VIEW_MOBILE.md).
  - **Account menu:** Bar shows **icon-only** **`#userMenuToggle`** — **hamburger** (**`.user-menu-hamburger`**, three **teal** bars on **dark blue** shell; **X** when **`.open`**), **`aria-label="Account menu"`**; **Welcome, {name}!** **right-aligned** in **`.user-menu-dropdown-header`**; **`#userMenuDropdownItems`** is **CSS grid** **`1fr`** so all menu buttons share **equal width**. **Dropdown:** **`width: max-content`**, **`max-width: min(260px, …)`**, **`align-items: stretch`** when **`.show`**.
  - **Overrides:** MV rules beat **`globalNav.css`** **`@media (max-width: 900px/600px)`** column stacking (**`flex-direction: row`** on **`.header-right`**).
- **Z-index:** Global nav dropdowns, popups, and tooltips use **z-index: 9999** (see repo [.cursorrules](../../.cursorrules)).
- **Roadmap / milestones:** [/MOBILE_DESIGN.md](../../MOBILE_DESIGN.md).
